"{\n  \"paper_id\": \"10.2139/ssrn.7109939\",\n  \"title\": \"A Comparative Linguistic Model of the Indus Script Based on Proto-Indo-Aryan Geochronology and Archaic Pre-Vedic Orthography\",\n  \"authors\": \"Sagar More\",\n  \"abstract\": \"<jats:p>This paper presents a comparative linguistic model evaluating the structural and phonetic relationships between the Indus script corpus and early Vedic orthography. Grounded in recent palaeo-hydrological timelines of the Saraswati River basin and late Bronze Age geochronology, the study establishes a contextual framework positioning the Indus Valley Civilization within the formative periods of Proto-Indo-Aryan development. Moving away from arbitrary signmatching, this research introduces a systematic cryptographic decoding methodology based on early Sanskrit grammatical paradigms and morphosyntactic structures. By applying these specific phonological constraints to the standard Indus seal sign distributions, the model evaluates whether the script operates as a logosyllabic system with a core consonantal framework. Preliminary results suggest a high degree of structural consistency when testing Indus graphemic sequences against Vedic Sanskrit phonetic rules, providing a reproducible pathway for analyzing sign-to-sound correspondences in the Indus corpus.</jats:p>\",\n  \"doi\": \"10.2139/ssrn.7109939\",\n  \"published_date\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\n  \"pdf_url\": \"\",\n  \"url\": \"https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.7109939\",\n  \"source\": \"crossref\",\n  \"updated_date\": \"\",\n  \"categories\": \"posted-content\",\n  \"keywords\": \"\",\n  \"citations\": 0,\n  \"references\": \"\",\n  \"extra\": \"{'publisher': 'Elsevier BV', 'container_title': '', 'volume': '', 'issue': '', 'page': '', 'issn': [], 'isbn': [], 'crossref_type': 'posted-content', 'member': '78', 'prefix': '10.2139'}\"\n}\n{\n  \"paper_id\": \"10.1162/coli_c_00030\",\n  \"title\": \"Entropy, the Indus Script, and Language:A Reply to R. Sproat\",\n  \"authors\": \"Rajesh P. N. Rao; Nisha Yadav; Mayank N. Vahia; Hrishikesh Joglekar; Ronojoy Adhikari; Iravatham Mahadevan\",\n  \"abstract\": \"\",\n  \"doi\": \"10.1162/coli_c_00030\",\n  \"published_date\": \"2010-12-01T00:00:00\",\n  \"pdf_url\": \"\",\n  \"url\": \"https://doi.org/10.1162/coli_c_00030\",\n  \"source\": \"crossref\",\n  \"updated_date\": \"\",\n  \"categories\": \"journal-article\",\n  \"keywords\": \"\",\n  \"citations\": 16,\n  \"references\": \"\",\n  \"extra\": \"{'publisher': 'MIT Press - Journals', 'container_title': 'Computational Linguistics', 'volume': '36', 'issue': '4', 'page': '795-805', 'issn': ['0891-2017', '1530-9312'], 'isbn': [], 'crossref_type': 'journal-article', 'member': '281', 'prefix': '10.1162'}\"\n}\n{\n  \"paper_id\": \"10.2307/j.ctvzgb7m5.8\",\n  \"title\": \"The Buddhist Indus Script\",\n  \"authors\": \"\",\n  \"abstract\": \"\",\n  \"doi\": \"10.2307/j.ctvzgb7m5.8\",\n  \"published_date\": \"2020-03-26T00:00:00\",\n  \"pdf_url\": \"\",\n  \"url\": \"https://doi.org/10.2307/j.ctvzgb7m5.8\",\n  \"source\": \"crossref\",\n  \"updated_date\": \"\",\n  \"categories\": \"book-chapter\",\n  \"keywords\": \"\",\n  \"citations\": 0,\n  \"references\": \"\",\n  \"extra\": \"{'publisher': 'Harrassowitz Verlag', 'container_title': 'The Buddhist Indus Script and Scriptures', 'volume': '', 'issue': '', 'page': '9-64', 'issn': [], 'isbn': [], 'crossref_type': 'book-chapter', 'member': '1121', 'prefix': '10.2307'}\"\n}\n{\n  \"paper_id\": \"10.2139/ssrn.4052072\",\n  \"title\": \"Guild-Based Trading, Taxation, Tax Farming, Trade and Craft Licensing, Access Control: Economic Practices of Indus Civilization Encoded in Indus Script\",\n  \"authors\": \"Bahata A. Mukhopadhyay\",\n  \"abstract\": \"\",\n  \"doi\": \"10.2139/ssrn.4052072\",\n  \"published_date\": \"2022-01-01T00:00:00\",\n  \"pdf_url\": \"\",\n  \"url\": \"https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.4052072\",\n  \"source\": \"crossref\",\n  \"updated_date\": \"\",\n  \"categories\": \"journa